1 2 [c] The iTrust2 Admin has authenticated themselves in the iTrust2 Medical Records system . A Patient is a registered user of the iTrust2 Medical Records system . The Patient has authenticated themselves in the iTrust2 Medical Records system . A Lab Tech is a registered user of the iTrust2 Medical Records system . The Lab Tech has authenticated themselves in the iTrust2 Medical Records system . A Lab Tech is a registered user of the iTrust2 Medical Records system . The Lab Tech has authenticated themselves in the iTrust2 Medical Records system . An HCP is a registered user of the iTrust2 Medical Records system . The HCP has authenticated themselves in the iTrust2 Medical Records system . The HCP has started documenting an office visit, including basic health metrics, for the patient [UC7 & UC8].
2 3 [s] admin The administrator enters the LOINC code, Long Common Name, Component, and Property of the procedure. They press Add Procedure .
